  "created": "2026-11-20T10:58:30.18Z",
  "description": "The ExpertPdf PDF Viewer displays PDF documents in Windows Forms and WPF applications with a modern, built-in viewer: page thumbnails, document outline (bookmarks) and attachments panels, text search and selection, zoom, page layouts and printing.\n\nFeatures\n- Windows Forms control (PdfViewer4WinNet.PdfViewer) and WPF control (PdfViewer4WinNet.Wpf.PdfViewer) with the same API\n- Load documents from a file, a stream or a byte array\n- Navigate, zoom, change the page layout and the navigation panels from code; DocumentLoaded, CurrentPageChanged and LoadError events\n- Print with the print dialog, or silently to a printer with a page range\n- Apply viewer preferences and security options (passwords, print and copy permissions) to the displayed document\n- No Adobe Reader: the viewer runs on the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (part of Windows 10 and Windows 11)\n- WebView2 Runtime deployment: the viewer can install a missing Evergreen runtime (InstallWebView2RuntimeIfMissing), and a fixed version runtime shipped in a WebView2Runtime folder next to the application is found automatically\n\nRequirements: .NET Framework 4.6.2 or later, or .NET 8 or later, on Windows. Windows only.",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
