  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10: rebuilt on Microsoft Edge WebView2 with a built-in PDF.js viewer (Adobe Reader is no longer needed). New WPF control, events, silent printing with page ranges, .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET 8+. Find text from code (Find, FindNext, FindPrevious, SearchCompleted), PasswordRequired event for password protected documents, light or dark theme (ViewerTheme) and individual toolbar buttons can be hidden. WebView2 Runtime deployment: Microsoft's WebView2 Runtime installer is copied next to the application and InstallWebView2RuntimeIfMissing / InstallWebView2Runtime() install a missing runtime; a fixed version runtime in a WebView2Runtime folder next to the application is used automatically; viewers on different runtimes get separate browser data folders.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Display PDF documents in Windows Forms and WPF applications with a modern built-in viewer. No Adobe Reader needed.",
  "title": "ExpertPdf PDF Viewer for Windows Forms and WPF",
